WEBVTT

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:10.440
I'm worn out.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:16.980
You never knock no matter how often you're told,

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:19.740
so it looks like I have to lock it instead!

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:21.540
Miss Yoshinoya...

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:24.670
You should take a moment out there to think about what you've done wrong.

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:29.210
Oh, Principal.

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:33.220
What!? The principal!?

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:37.220
Miss Yoshinoya!?

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:40.600
Miss Yoshinoya? Yoshinoya!?

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:49.500
Sorry, Miss Yoshinoya. I lied.

00:00:55.030 --> 00:01:00.030
May 28th~June 6th

00:00:55.030 --> 00:01:00.030
"Sunshine Palette"

00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:11.190
Good morning, Nazuna!

00:01:11.190 --> 00:01:12.550
Good morning!

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:14.130
Good morning.

00:01:14.130 --> 00:01:18.130
I'm sorry! I overslept.

00:01:18.130 --> 00:01:21.930
It's fine, Nazuna. If anything, you're up early.

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:24.340
That's right. It's not like you have to be here.

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:25.140
Right!

00:01:25.610 --> 00:01:27.310
Let's keep going.

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:35.070
May 28th

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:35.570
Orange

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:36.570
Yellow

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:45.030
We're almost done.

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:48.500
Yeah, I'm done as soon as I restock this.

00:02:10.090 --> 00:02:11.020
Yunocchi?

00:02:14.020 --> 00:02:16.370
What's wrong, Yunocchi?

00:02:16.370 --> 00:02:21.090
I flushed my room key.

00:02:21.090 --> 00:02:21.860
Your key!?

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:25.740
I wonder if I can get it back with a sploosher.

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:27.240
Oh, a glogger?

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:29.660
Do we have a glogger?

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:31.330
Nami!

00:02:31.770 --> 00:02:34.550
Do you have a toilet splodger over there?

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:38.210
Here's a plunger.

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:41.340
Plunger?

00:02:43.340 --> 00:02:46.600
Well, that just won't do, now will it?

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:48.600
I'm sorry.

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:50.680
Apology
Meeting

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:53.340
My spare is in my room too.

00:02:53.350 --> 00:02:57.480
At least we don't need to change the lock.

00:02:57.480 --> 00:02:59.780
Hold on, and I'll get my spare.

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:02.480
Okay. Sorry to bother you about this.

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:04.990
I think it's around here somewhere.

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:14.510
Can it wait a couple days?

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.900
I hope she can find it in a couple days.

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:22.800
Yeah. But what do I do until then?

00:03:25.150 --> 00:03:28.770
You can stay at my place as long as you like.

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:30.340
Are you sure?

00:03:30.340 --> 00:03:33.600
Sure. I don't have a TV or a radio, though.

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:36.860
Thanks! That really helps.

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:40.360
My car's pretty slow too.

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:41.530
Your car?

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:44.150
My place is like that.

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:50.290
We're home!

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:52.500
I'm coming in!

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:59.500
Lucky you. I just got a lot of food.

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:02.510
You're sure you don't mind me having some?

00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:03.010
No problem.

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:07.140
What shall we have for dinner tonight?

00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:11.630
Japanese, French, Chinese, I've got it all.

00:04:11.630 --> 00:04:12.930
What do you want?

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:16.770
Um... Japanese, then!

00:04:20.180 --> 00:04:22.030
Buns!?

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:31.950
The layout is the same, but it feels a bit different.

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:37.270
Yunocchi, I'm leaving a towel and some clothes out for you.

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:38.750
Thanks.

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:46.470
I think this might be the first time I've stayed over at Miya's place.

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:50.140
Miya!

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:55.220
How do you have a change of panties for me?

00:04:56.640 --> 00:05:00.360
I grabbed your laundry off your balcony.

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:11.830
Hey Yuno, I thought of a way we can have more room to sleep!

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:21.630
Sorry, Miya... This feels kind of weird.

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:22.800
Really?

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:25.130
May 29th

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:25.630
Orange

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:26.630
Pink

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:37.680
The window was locked, wasn't it?

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:39.060
Yeah.

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:42.110
Miya, do you have a coathanger?

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:53.460
I know I don't know how to do this, but I have to try.

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:01.750
It won't come out!

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:06.880
Yunocchi!

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:09.380
It came out.

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:11.930
What are you two doing up this early?

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:14.000
Sae! Hiro!

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:18.060
Well, uh...

00:06:22.190 --> 00:06:26.670
Oh, that's all? You should have told me earlier.

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:28.940
Why not stay at my place tonight?

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:32.820
My place is fine too, and I'm sure the first years would also let you stay with them.

00:06:35.510 --> 00:06:37.080
Maybe Miya can tag along.

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:39.550
Miyako can stay at her own place.

00:06:43.690 --> 00:06:47.550
I'm terribly sorry to impose on you.

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:49.720
She's taking this seriously.

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:52.590
It has to be in here.

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:56.430
That's where I put that?

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:04.560
You should have told us, Yuno!

00:07:04.560 --> 00:07:07.890
You can stay at my place tomorrow.

00:07:07.890 --> 00:07:09.680
Thanks!

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:11.860
How about you, Nazuna?

00:07:11.860 --> 00:07:13.820
Sure, it's fine.

00:07:13.840 --> 00:07:16.740
She'll probably find the key tomorrow.

00:07:17.150 --> 00:07:18.740
That's right.

00:07:21.190 --> 00:07:25.390
Ambition... Stewardess!?

00:07:25.390 --> 00:07:28.670
That hurts. That really hurts.

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:33.800
Thanks, Nori and Nazuna.

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:39.260
If she still hasn't found the key by tomorrow, I'll stay with you.

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:39.930
Okay!

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:42.770
Yunocchi, you can always come back to my place.

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:43.440
Sure!

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:49.730
Hiro, I'm done.

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:54.070
They're a bit big for you, but you look good in them.

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:55.950
Thanks.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:08:01.500
Are you okay with just moistener and lotion?

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:02.200
I guess?

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:04.580
Oh, don't you use them?

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:05.350
Not really.

00:08:05.350 --> 00:08:10.250
If you use them after you wash your face, your skin will get nice and soft.

00:08:11.020 --> 00:08:12.170
I'll try them on you.

00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:25.100
It's so springy!

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:36.230
Hiro! You're going to be late!

00:08:37.220 --> 00:08:38.950
Five more minutes...

00:08:38.950 --> 00:08:40.950
You can't wait any longer!

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:49.250
Smoke, don't smoke... Smoke, don't smoke... Yeah, I'm gonna end up smoking.

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:52.170
Maybe I'll find it after a smoke.

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:55.800
Thank you.

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:57.010
Come right in!

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:02.180
Those curtains you bought really are cute.

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:08.440
Yeah. I'd never gotten ones like them before, but I like them.

00:09:11.270 --> 00:09:15.030
Is this a magazine you usually read?

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:17.280
Yeah. That one's about computers.

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:19.260
I read it once in a while.

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:31.730
Do you keep your computer like that when you're not using it?

00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:35.770
Yeah, I put a cloth over it to keep dust from getting in.

00:09:37.460 --> 00:09:38.800
You want to boot it up?

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:49.540
Not right now. Maybe later.

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:52.900
Okay. Anytime's fine.

00:09:53.360 --> 00:09:55.230
All right, I'm turning off the light.

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:56.400
Okay.

00:09:57.190 --> 00:10:01.510
So, you sleep better in the dark?

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:06.320
Some people can't sleep without a night light.

00:10:07.030 --> 00:10:12.750
I can fall asleep even with the lights on.

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:19.220
When I was little, I was afraid of the dark, but I'm fine now.

00:10:24.170 --> 00:10:26.560
This feels funny.

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:28.310
Really?

00:10:29.890 --> 00:10:34.060
I know a way we can stretch out.

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:41.410
Yuno, this doesn't seem quite right.

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:43.090
You're right.

00:10:50.110 --> 00:10:52.420
Roll, roll, roll, roll, roll, roll, roll.

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:55.190
Turning over in bed!

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:01.170
Huh?

00:11:02.010 --> 00:11:04.470
This brings back memories.

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:08.180
I thought I sold these to the used bookstore.

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:34.500
Sorry, Nazuna, and thanks for having me over.

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:35.750
Of course.

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:39.950
Are you doing your homework?

00:11:39.950 --> 00:11:43.180
Yeah, it's pretty tough.

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:45.260
Math, huh?

00:11:45.260 --> 00:11:48.560
I'm not really that good at it, but I'll help.

00:11:49.190 --> 00:11:50.350
Thanks!

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:53.380
Use this formula here.

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:54.600
I see.

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:57.610
Just one question left, Nazuna.

00:11:57.610 --> 00:11:59.590
I'll try doing it by myself.

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:07.100
I'm done.

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:08.580
Let's see...

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:14.050
Yeah, you got it right.

00:12:14.050 --> 00:12:17.040
Thank you, Yuno.

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:20.410
You explained it really clearly, so it was easy to understand.

00:12:20.410 --> 00:12:25.220
That's good. As long as you remember the formula, you can use it over and over.

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:27.590
I feel like I get it now.

00:12:30.050 --> 00:12:30.970
Get what?

00:12:30.970 --> 00:12:34.980
This must be what having a big sister feels like.

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:37.450
Big sister...

00:12:38.100 --> 00:12:40.860
I'm an only child.

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:43.650
Me too.

00:12:51.960 --> 00:12:53.820
I'm done.

00:12:58.120 --> 00:13:00.840
Nazuna, you have your hair down!

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:03.710
Yeah, I take it down when I sleep.

00:13:03.710 --> 00:13:06.690
It's like when I saw Nori that way yesterday.

00:13:06.690 --> 00:13:09.710
I don't see you like that often, so it seems fresh.

00:13:09.710 --> 00:13:11.530
Really?

00:13:11.530 --> 00:13:12.220
Yeah!

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:14.470
You're cute with it down too.

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:19.980
I'm turning off the light.

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:20.860
Okay.

00:13:22.720 --> 00:13:26.280
So, you're one of those people who uses a night light.

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:29.780
Oh, nothing.

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:33.650
I can't find it.

00:13:37.160 --> 00:13:39.210
No way it'd be there.

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:48.090
I guess she still can't find the key.

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:50.840
Sorry to bother you.

00:13:50.840 --> 00:13:52.120
Don't worry about it.

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:54.140
She sure can be a pain sometimes.

00:13:55.390 --> 00:13:59.390
Isn't it inconvenient not being able to go back to your room for a few days?

00:13:59.390 --> 00:14:02.000
It's better than I expected.

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:07.560
I can borrow Miya's textbooks, and I had my phone and wallet with me.

00:14:07.560 --> 00:14:09.450
Yeah, you're right.

00:14:09.470 --> 00:14:13.030
Miya was able to grab my clothes off my balcony too.

00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:17.040
Oh, it's Chika.

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:18.290
Chika?

00:14:19.070 --> 00:14:21.360
Hi, Chika!

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:24.920
Hi, Yuno? You're staying with my big sis?

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:29.760
Yeah. Everyone's letting me stay over until we find my key.

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:31.090
Sounds like a lot of trouble.

00:14:31.500 --> 00:14:34.020
So, you're with my sister tonight?

00:14:34.020 --> 00:14:35.100
Yeah.

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:38.550
Be careful. She tosses and turns.

00:14:39.090 --> 00:14:40.100
Got it.

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:45.360
So, what did Chika have to say?

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:49.910
I texted her earlier saying I was staying at your place tonight.

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:52.820
It's Chika.

00:14:52.820 --> 00:14:53.660
Chika?

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:55.270
Hello?

00:14:55.270 --> 00:15:00.670
Hi, sis. Just wanted to tell you not to kick Yuno in your sleep.

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:02.460
Like I'd do that!

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:13.260
Sae, you can go ahead now.

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:16.930
I've gotta finish up this manuscript, but you can go to bed.

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:18.260
Got it.

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:40.790
Maybe it's—

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:45.330
Oh my.

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:48.710
Which one of you forgot your book?

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:51.080
Sorry, I did.

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:53.740
Teacher, Yunocchi got locked—

00:15:53.740 --> 00:15:55.190
I don't want to hear it!

00:15:55.190 --> 00:15:58.600
It doesn't matter what excuse she has. She still forgot it.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:02.520
Okay everyone, turn to the next page.

00:16:08.130 --> 00:16:11.150
Wait, Yuno, you still haven't gotten back in your room?

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:16.030
It's been five days, right?

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:17.870
Where are you sleeping?

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:21.700
Everyone's been kind enough to let me stay with them.

00:16:21.700 --> 00:16:24.650
You've conquered Hidamari Apartments!

00:16:25.370 --> 00:16:29.590
I wish Miss Yoshinoya had at least listened to your explanation.

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:30.750
Yeah.

00:16:31.270 --> 00:16:32.510
Yuno...

00:16:33.250 --> 00:16:36.260
You haven't been home in five days!?

00:16:36.260 --> 00:16:39.510
All right, you can stay at my place!

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:40.760
Thanks!

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:42.520
That'll be great!

00:16:42.520 --> 00:16:44.730
A sleepover will be fun.

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:45.980
Yuno!

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:50.230
Are you really sleeping all over without going home!?

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:51.980
Miss Yoshinoya!?

00:16:51.980 --> 00:16:56.400
You should have told me! I'm your teacher!

00:16:56.400 --> 00:16:58.100
Ah, um...

00:16:58.100 --> 00:17:02.010
I know how hard it is for a girl to go through puberty!

00:17:02.010 --> 00:17:04.290
I know why you'd want to run away from home!

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:06.210
It's not like that.

00:17:06.210 --> 00:17:09.960
I'm not trying to make you have a reason for it!

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:12.210
Leaving home for no reason!

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:14.670
Screaming at the ocean!

00:17:14.670 --> 00:17:16.260
You're at the age for that!

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:18.260
Um...

00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:23.520
When I don't finish my natto because I hate it, Dad scolds me!

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:27.600
When I take two hours in the bathroom in the morning, Mom scolds me!

00:17:28.350 --> 00:17:32.360
I just couldn't decide on my hairstyle!

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:37.910
It's so hard to go home on days when you've been scolded.

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:41.160
Such days plague me even now!

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:44.660
Miss Yoshinoya, Yunocchi lives alone.

00:17:45.510 --> 00:17:48.340
I've done that too.

00:17:48.340 --> 00:17:51.610
But it's still not good to run away!

00:17:52.990 --> 00:17:58.550
I'm so sorry I didn't realize you were unhappy enough to run away from home!

00:18:06.430 --> 00:18:08.200
I've got to go after her.

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:09.310
Go for it, Yunocchi!

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:18.570
My place again tonight, huh?

00:18:18.570 --> 00:18:20.570
Yeah, thanks.

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:23.320
Then Nori's again tomorrow.

00:18:24.840 --> 00:18:25.580
Yo!

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:27.370
Landlady!

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:30.620
Man, sorry I took so long.

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:32.880
I finally found it.

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:35.670
Was it in your closet?

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:37.340
To be honest...

00:18:41.070 --> 00:18:43.850
See, I knew it'd be here!

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:48.670
Can't see the forest for the trees, huh?

00:18:48.670 --> 00:18:52.060
Sounds like a security problem.

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:54.310
Here's your key.

00:18:56.320 --> 00:18:58.320
That sure was tough to find.

00:19:01.820 --> 00:19:04.030
It still is tough to find.

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:08.600
Do your best! Do your best!

00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:10.620
This looks kind of like it.

00:19:12.620 --> 00:19:13.870
It opened!

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:15.630
Oh, great!

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:19.370
Sorry to bother you.

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:21.220
Me too.

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:24.140
Well, see you later.

00:19:26.180 --> 00:19:28.710
Thanks, Miya.

00:19:28.710 --> 00:19:30.480
You're welcome.

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:40.610
Home sweet home.

00:19:49.140 --> 00:19:52.330
Sorry, Miya, can I stay here tonight?

00:19:53.230 --> 00:19:55.670
My miso soup from five days ago...

00:19:56.100 --> 00:19:58.520
My miso soup...

00:19:58.520 --> 00:20:00.840
Tofu sure goes downhill fast.

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:05.340
I don't want to face reality until tomorrow.

00:20:22.530 --> 00:20:24.280
I've kept you waiting.

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:26.860
It's been a while, hasn't it?

00:20:26.860 --> 00:20:28.030
Sorry.

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:32.950
Look, this is Miya's bathroom.

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:35.540
Sometimes this is fun too.

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:43.200
Why do we call melon bread melon bread?

00:20:43.220 --> 00:20:45.420
Isn't it because it's made with melon juice?

00:20:45.440 --> 00:20:46.960
Because it looks like a melon.

00:20:46.960 --> 00:20:48.760
Then how about strawberry melon bread?

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:50.780
Chocolate melon bread is tasty too.

00:20:50.780 --> 00:20:53.160
I like Tsugaru apple melon bread.

00:20:53.160 --> 00:20:54.320
What's that?

00:20:54.320 --> 00:20:57.200
It has apple jam inside.

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:59.220
That's not melon at all!

00:20:59.220 --> 00:21:05.920
